 exists mf P,certificate Execution.ge P(Returnstate(Result f)Kstop mf)/\P(Execution.entry(Args bo bi po pi)m)/\Post m mf bo bi po pi f.
Proof. intros m bo bi po pi f[OI[W RD]].
